{"summary":"A retro-inspired, pixel art, point and click adventure","description":"*TRY BEFORE YOU BUY!* \nThe Abandoned Planet is free to try with the first chapter available at no cost. Unlock the full adventure with a one-time purchase.\n\nWhen a wormhole tears open in space, an astronaut is hurled down and crashes on a distant planet. But where is she? Where are all the inhabitants of the planet? And how is she going to get back home? Solve the puzzle and piece together the mystery in this 2D, pixel art, first person, point and click adventure.\n\nInspired by games like Myst and Riven with a dash of the LucasArt adventures of the 90s, The Abandoned Planet is sure to scratch that old-school, adventure game itch.\n\n• Beautiful chunky pixel art\n• Hundreds of locations to explore\n• Classic point and click adventure\n• Fully voiced in English\n\nText localized into the following languages:\n\n• English\n• Spanish\n• Italian\n• French\n• German\n• Japanese\n• Korean\n• Portuguese\n• Russian\n• Chinese Simplified\n• Chinese Traditional","esrbNotes":null,"pegiNotes":"Fear","iapPrices":"$5.99 per item","video":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/5qyI6zV3M9k?vq=large&rel=0&autohide=1&showinfo=0","header":"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/8_BAkGPTE1shP8r_hIE2pEmM23t6WCTtqoMAJXAfLy3IGcImHW_F6qhhTJQfaYcdY_Cy4HtASl-OW1uIWzB7mg","screenshots":["https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/Fn8b15nVZul7YAxMorYSNx0DNJMi3iLMwZk8MYqW3Got9R2UICT4qrfC3iGfTPNmMzn49nBRUDTo0fqq-uzMcQ","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/_W0Ae-mW2zmbcCdENoptqHtPWE7riFk3D520Ck44uiQxdr6TouNRsJZWQMeXsx-5N-cwCx5t1-Ms06772lbv","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/Y0_y1dOwE2mONvjNLHr2VwARMvXB2EWsAl2qbbouYwm2uucE3YWE7cHOuX9zRmQKDPooWDZVG-giDX2IsjMmMg","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/x6sV-lRrGT7JJY1vrIUA5-nLxLsOqB1wfLSyQGnZMogBSsCOE3IiLux3v60eRLRTJWQsvbOW4C51C7C0MIwNHNc","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/HsqyKE5_rnh_bSZ0y6dkrUZnxURqP3dj4ZK1Ry7I1TphH3S9zmoLsdOa-uRqioK5p2zCdMHxSwDLFG-dxkYZDg","https:/